# Curated research-release repository.
# Default-deny keeps raw data, local environments, staged reruns, caches, and
# large exploratory artifacts out of GitHub.
*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE
!environment.yml
!public_inputs_manifest.tsv
!/.github/
!/.github/**

!/outputs/
!/outputs/cee_submission_latex_v0_8_english_article/
!/outputs/cee_submission_latex_v0_8_english_article/**
outputs/cee_submission_latex_v0_8_english_article/*.aux
outputs/cee_submission_latex_v0_8_english_article/*.log
outputs/cee_submission_latex_v0_8_english_article/*.out
outputs/cee_submission_latex_v0_8_english_article/*.fls
outputs/cee_submission_latex_v0_8_english_article/*.fdb_latexmk
outputs/cee_submission_latex_v0_8_english_article/*.synctex.gz
outputs/cee_submission_latex_v0_8_english_article/**/__pycache__/
outputs/cee_submission_latex_v0_8_english_article/**/*.pyc
outputs/cee_submission_latex_v0_8_english_article/.DS_Store
outputs/cee_submission_latex_v0_8_english_article/reference_audit/
outputs/cee_submission_latex_v0_8_english_article/references_pdfs/
outputs/cee_submission_latex_v0_8_english_article/predictable-long-period-site-residuals-cee-*.pdf
